# Image Catalog

FreeBSD-native OCI applications, multi-service stacks, and network appliances built for **fjord**, **Podman**, and **AppJail**.

<div class="fleet-controls">
  <div class="fleet-top-row">
    <div class="fleet-search-box">
      <svg class="fleet-search-icon" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"></circle><path d="m21 21-4.3-4.3"></path></svg>
      <input type="search" id="image-search" placeholder="Search by app, slug, or capability (e.g. Immich, uptime-kuma, s3, oidc)..." aria-label="Search Image Catalog" autocomplete="off">
    </div>

    <div class="fleet-scope-bar" role="group" aria-label="Filter by image scope">
      <button type="button" class="fleet-scope-btn active" data-scope="apps" aria-pressed="true">
        <span>Apps</span>
        <span class="fleet-scope-count">{{ apps_top | length }}</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="fleet-scope-btn" data-scope="stacks" aria-pressed="false">
        <span>Stacks</span>
        <span class="fleet-scope-count">{{ stacks_top | length }}</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="fleet-scope-btn" data-scope="appliances" aria-pressed="false">
        <span>Appliances</span>
        <span class="fleet-scope-count">{{ appliances_top | length }}</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="fleet-scope-btn" data-scope="base" aria-pressed="false">
        <span>Base &amp; CLI</span>
        <span class="fleet-scope-count">{{ base_cli_top | length }}</span>
      </button>
      <button type="button" class="fleet-scope-btn" data-scope="all" aria-pressed="false">
        <span>All</span>
        <span class="fleet-scope-count">{{ active_configs | length }}</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="fleet-category-bar" id="fleet-category-bar" role="group" aria-label="Filter by category">
    <button type="button" class="fleet-cat-tab active" data-category="all" aria-pressed="true">
      <span>All Categories</span>
      <span class="fleet-cat-count">{{ apps_top | length }}</span>
    </button>
    {%- for cat in ordered_cats %}
